# The shop's web server and its neighbours, on one switch.
#
#   office    10.0.9.2    a customer's laptop
#   web       10.0.9.1    nginx: www.shop.test; certbot
#   ca        10.0.9.5    the shop's certificate authority (step-ca), ca.shop.test:9000
#   resolver  10.0.9.53   the shop's name server (Unbound)
#
# Every machine asks the resolver for names.
machine office
machine web
machine ca
machine resolver

lan shopnet office:eth0=10.0.9.2/24 web:eth0=10.0.9.1/24 ca:eth0=10.0.9.5/24 resolver:eth0=10.0.9.53/24

dns office 10.0.9.53
dns web 10.0.9.53
dns ca 10.0.9.53

run resolver unbound
run web nginx
